for.com/article/07/31/2026/the-socialist-network ; https://thenationaldesk.com/news/nation-world/dsa-unveils-new-platform-including-radical-structural-changes-to-us-government-dsa-melot-kiros-democrat-party-republicans"},{"group":"Justice Democrats","note":"Required pledge (2026): no money from corporate PACs, AIPAC, crypto or AI lobbies. Policy list is the group's published platform.","planks":["Refuse corporate PAC, lobbyist, AIPAC, crypto and AI-industry money (required pledge)","Medicare for All","Green New Deal","Tax the rich; expand Social Security","Cancel student debt; free public college and trade school","Living wage, federal jobs guarantee, stronger unions","Housing as a human right","Democracy reform and voting rights; immigrant rights","Progressive foreign policy"],"source":"https://justicedemocrats.com/platform ; https://www.goodmorningamerica.com/news/story/progressive-group-rolls-2026-candidates-pitching-working-class-130285755"},{"group":"Our Revolution","note":"No formal 2026 candidate pledge found; planks are from its homepage framing ('Fight Trump & the Oligarchs' 3-point strategy). It also signed on to the CPC Affordability Agenda.","planks":["Fight oligarchy and corporate power ('Defund Oligarchy')","Get big, corporate and dark money out of politics","Medicare for All","Affordability / cost-of-living economic populism","Workers' rights and collective bargaining","Opposition to war funding","Primary challenges and new leadership for Democratic Party establishment"],"source":"https://ourrevolution.com/"},{"group":"Working Families Party","note":"2026 national agenda 'Working Families Guarantee' (April 2026); full text not retrieved, planks from NOTUS/Mother Jones coverage.","planks":["Federal jobs program offering union jobs to offset AI-driven job losses","Affordable housing","Guaranteed low-cost childcare","12 weeks paid family and medical leave for all workers","Single-payer health care","Higher taxes on the wealthy to pay for it"],"source":"https://www.notus.org/2026-election/wfp-agenda-ai-jobs-program ; https://www.motherjones.com/politics/2026/04/the-working-families-party-is-riding-the-anti-ai-wave/"},{"group":"Congressional Progressive Caucus","note":"2026 agenda is the 'New Affordability Agenda' (10 bills, April 29, 2026). 'Progressive Proposition' was the 2024 agenda for 2025.","planks":["Government generic-drug discount program to cut prescription costs","Crack down on for-profit utilities overcharging customers","Windfall tax on oil companies' wartime profits, rebated to consumers","Cap childcare at 7% of family income","Build millions of homes, $20,000 first-time buyer down-payment aid, more rental assistance","Crack down on grocery price-fixing and seed-patent abuse","Two weeks guaranteed paid vacation for every worker","Ban surveillance pricing using personal data and AI","Double-time overtime pay","Abolish super PACs"],"source":"https://progressives.house.gov/2026/4/progressive-caucus-announces-new-affordability-agenda"}]}